title: Replace All in the Search panel asks how many occurrences in how many files, then writes step_1 as first_step in steps.rs and main.rs and leaves step_10 alone (Whole Word on)
folders: plain
limit: 50
forbid-log: WARN.*script
forbid-log: script: ignoring
expect-log: search 'step_1': 2 hits
expect-log: replaced 2 matches in 2 files \(0 could not be read\)
expect-file: plain/src/steps.rs :: (?s)fn first_step\(\) -> u32 \{\n    1\n\}.*fn step_10\(\)
expect-file: plain/src/main.rs :: steps::first_step\(\)

wait 3000
search-option word on
search step_1
wait 1500
search-option replace first_step
wait 400
mark replace-typed
wait 450
search-option replace-all
wait 800
mark asked-how-many
wait 450
answer Replace
wait 2500
mark replaced
wait 450
quit
